  "content": "\n\n<p>《史诗骑士：冰与火》是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗骑士</a>模组的一款令人兴奋的扩展，它与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰与火</a>模组相融合。该模组为玩家提供了20种使用冰与火模组中14种材料打造的新武器类型，每种武器均带有其独特的专属特效。</p>\n<p>本项目要求已安装&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗骑士</a>模组及其所有前置依赖。大部分贴图由StaxiHD制作。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1030/206/weapons.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"591\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
